s and shakes, vibrating with new corrupt forces.","source_tag":"log","target":"#GREEN#你将心脏放在祭坛上。心脏跳动、收缩，最终被堕落力量腐化。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"89745d0d4f0398a43b9f1ac5163f17d0d758ac977266812aa5b58bb1c31d108b","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1b2275bdc81ec1bb845478c4087eb63fa16b95de7f6fb247c1998906f35e7dd9","logical_entry_identity":"63e07f3eb14427003c78d3179f28945ae032d2f4e60441b13f6327425cc31c2f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"minutes","source_tag":"_t","target":"分钟"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1ebfb1301511846aa36430ebc36077e9ac968cad032c16154fa8719fca161c60","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1b3242d79b0465565ee35dcdcff5551285495c580aced4f6146fa5d9665457f8","logical_entry_identity":"c35444546f3f5f2f6343e8a3cf24780baf96aedaabfae4a862176ba541edd755","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Attack the target with either your ranged or melee weapons for %d%% weapon damage.  For the next %d turns random targeting, such as from Blink Blade and Warden's Call, will focus on this target.\n\t\tAttacks against this target gain %d%% critical chance and critical strike power while you take %d%% less damage from all enemies whose rank is lower then that of your focus target.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"使用你的远程或者近战武器对目标造成 %d%% 武器伤害。  在接下来的 %d 回合中，你的随机目标技能，比如闪烁灵刃和守卫召唤将会集中命中目标。\n\t\t对这个目标的攻击获得 %d%% 额外的暴击几率和暴击加成，同时其他分级低于目标的单位对你造成的伤害减少 %d%%。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3e1dcf5f70a3019949b56b964556027ed69bf3f84bd560158155e69f99ba4e18","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1b3628715f5925536eb494e31bf375f16a9ce8890c49048d0154e0eae80b197a","logical_entry_identity":"e230753cb03a3d6a72b74347ed9d658f677375fa517fdb896e665d4d2a0d6bca","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Woeful Corrosion","source_tag":"_t","target":"恐怖酸蚀"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"d1982b7aadac0723559ccdf604325d5d7ee9e07a6f66a2fa25f1a259ac7f96c4","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"1b3898af4411c7f1495be2164f77415d82c2714e1b6c